# The build needs the web app, the CLI source, the lockfiles and the entrypoint. Keeping
# everything else out of the context keeps the build fast and keeps anything a developer
# happens to have lying around out of the image.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!web/

# Nothing under web/ that the build makes for itself, or that only tests use.
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/docs/screenshots/
